<title>FRANCE: Suez confirms return to profit in H1 96.</title>
<headline>Suez confirms return to profit in H1 96.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>French holding company Suez's chairman confirmed on Thursday that Suez would show a profit in its first-half 1996 results.</p>
<p>&quot;I had predicted a profit for 1996, I confirm the return to profit in the first half of 1996,&quot; Gerard Mestrallet told a banking conference.</p>
<p>He added that accounts for the first half of the year had not yet been finalised.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5071</p>
</text>
